  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It appears in the middle of the lake surrounded by other mosquitoes and keeps the Tiger Mosquito's aggressive pattern: thrusts, combos, and fast dives while repositioning around the player.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is a much tougher and more dangerous version of the Tiger Mosquito. Its attacks can trigger effects based on its current infusion, so taking repeated hits can make the fight deteriorate very quickly.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It usually appears alongside other mosquitoes, which can constantly interfere during the fight and make it difficult to focus on the O.G.R.R. variant.",
  "strategy": "Before engaging it, kill the surrounding mosquitoes first to make the fight as clean as possible. If you need cover, you can hide beneath lily pads to avoid some of its attacks. Ideally, fight it one-on-one and learn the Tiger Mosquito's pattern beforehand by practicing against normal variants. Always check which infusion is active and avoid using that same element against it. Above all, try not to take damage so its effects do not trigger or build up. Perfect blocks remain an excellent opportunity to knock it down and punish it while vulnerable.",
